{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54836","headline":"兵要望江南 占鼠第十八（京本列第十○十首） 五 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占鼠第十八（京本列第十○十首） 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"军营内，行鼠尾舒前。\n将（京本作「军」）主有灾须醮谢，夜深谷口（京本作「各各」、辛本、川本作「谷谷」）罢戈（京本作「兵」）鋋，太白（京本作「天似」）报人言。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54836.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54836","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}